---
// Organism: DownloadApp
// Points visitors to install the dashboard PWA from the browser.
---

<section class="landing-section-compact bg-bg-primary" id="descargar">
  <div class="landing-container text-center">
    <div class="landing-eyebrow border border-border bg-white/5 text-text-primary mb-6 mx-auto">En tu celular</div>
    <h2 class="landing-title font-headline font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Instalá la app. Un toque y listo.</h2>
    <p class="landing-lead text-text-secondary font-body mb-8 mx-auto">
      Tocá Instalar y Orvel queda en tu pantalla de inicio, como cualquier app. No hay tienda ni archivo para bajar.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/dashboard/installar"
      class="bg-primary text-on-secondary px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-headline font-bold text-base hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(162,207,203,0.4)] transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
    >
      Instalar app <i class="ri-download-line text-base"></i>
    </a>
    <p class="text-text-primary/70 text-xs mt-6 font-body">
      En iPhone: Compartir → Agregar a pantalla de inicio.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
